Just sit back and relax because from now on we will do everything to make your flights more comfortable and stress-free 24/7.

- Search Flights by route & flight code;
Access detailed information such as estimated time of arrival, the actual time of departure, terminal and gate number, route, distance, duration, and flight time left. The app supports over 850 airlines.
- Stay up-to-date on your flight status changes with Live Alerts;
Receive automatic real-time updates via push notifications.
- Track flights on Apple Watch;
Receive flight updates and check gate, terminal, departure & arrival information.
- Get detailed Airports Info;
Including terminal maps, local time, and actual weather. 
- Keep the Flight Board in your pocket;  
Easy access to arrivals & departure info. 
- Watch airplanes move around the world with real-time Plane Radar; 
You can tap on a plane to get detailed flight info and customize the map with useful filters, such as choosing one of three map styles or hiding airport locations or aircraft.
- Upload Travel Documents and keep everything in one place;
Quickly access your boarding pass, vaccination certificates, booking confirmations, etc, and add relevant notes directly in the app.
- View historical data of your Past Flights;
Share your flight information with others via email, text, Facebook, Twitter, and WhatsApp.
- With automated Calendar and TripIt sync, managing your travel plans has never been easier!

Upgrade to PREMIUM to enjoy Ad-free usage and Premium Customer Support. 

Terms & Conditions: https://impalastudios.com/terms 
Privacy Policy: https://impalastudios.com/privacy 

Thank you for choosing The Flight Tracker app, and enjoy your flight. 
If you have any questions or feedback, please contact us at support@impalastudios.com. 

We are always happy to improve alongside you!

FIND A LOCAL FOR A TAILOR-MADE CITY TOUR
Where’s your next trip? With the Showaround app, you can book a local for a private tour whilst on-the-go and take traveling to a completely different level – meet locals from all around the world and discover the true beauty of any city from an insider’s perspective. Choose the perfect buddy to explore a new place with based on their personality, hobbies, or experience. 

ARRANGE ACTIVITIES 
Create your own personalised tour, plan activities in advance, and communicate with locals, all in one place. Skip the tourist traps and spend time visiting the sights that truly interest you - whether it’s an art gallery opening, sipping Champagne on a terrace somewhere, or just walking along the streets of an old town, Showaround locals will have you covered.

SIGN UP AS A LOCAL
Become a Showaround local, give tours in your city, and get a chance to meet students, backpackers, professionals and other travelers from every corner of the world. Share with them the best your city has to offer – and with flexible schedule, you can show people around as much as you like, whenever you like.

AS A TOURIST, YOU CAN:
• Automatically see the locals in the selected area;
• Filter locals according to your search criteria: languages, activities and more;
• When traveling, you can simply create a Trip for your next destination and receive offers from locals with suggestions for your visit.

AS A LOCAL, YOU CAN:
• Add photos to your travel profile;
• Specify the languages you can speak;
• Write a bit about yourself;
• Tell more about what kind of guided tours you’re offering, including activities such as nightlife, culture, food, etc.;
• See how many tourists are looking for a local buddy in your hometown;
• Send offers to visitors. 

-------------------------------------

We will ask you to enable the Location Background mode on your device in order to track your current location and suggest locals nearby. As with most apps, please be aware that continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.

The payment method for the Membership is an auto-recurring periodic subscription method. Membership can be purchased for the duration of one month (from 9,99 EUR to 59,99 EUR), three months (from 19,99 EUR to 119,99 EUR) or one year (from 59,99 EUR to 349,99 EUR).  The payment method for the Membership is an auto-recurring periodic subscription method. When you initially subscribe for a Membership, you will be charged immediately for the initial period of the Subscription at the then-current fee. If you purchase an auto-recurring periodic subscription through an in app purchase, your IAP Account will be billed continuously for the subscription until you cancel. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. After your initial subscription commitment period, and again after any subsequent subscription period, your subscription will automatically continue for an additional equivalent period, at the price you agreed to when subscribing. If you do not wish your subscription to renew automatically, or if you want to change or terminate your subscription, you will need to log in to your IAP account and follow instructions to cancel your subscription at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. You can read more on https://www.showaround.com/info/terms-of-service and https://www.showaround.com/info/privacy-policy pages.
